flowchart LR
  Document[Lossless or legacy Markdown] --> Validate[Validate document contract]
  Validate -->|invalid| Finding[Structural finding]
  Validate --> Decode{Frontmatter decode failed?}
  Decode -->|yes| Finding
  Decode -->|no / partial / complete| Select[Select one profile]
  Registry[Profile registry] --> Select
  Select -->|one match| Project[Project Artifact]
  Select -->|zero or many| Finding
  Project --> Facets[Validate declared facets]
  Schemas[Facet schema registry] --> Facets
  Facets -->|valid| Artifact[Validated Artifact]
  Facets -->|invalid| Finding
  Decode -. evidence carried .-> Finding
  Decode -. evidence carried .-> Artifact
